        "id": 1000187
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-07-15T17:05:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The linux coding style guide is silent on this.\n\nThe rest of our code uses \"const struct foo *\".\n\nIt seems easier to mix up \"struct foo const *\" and \"struct foo * const\" than \"const struct foo *\".\n\nBut I also hate style arguments.",
      "parentUuid": "3837466d_412a3233",
