      "writtenOn": "2015-07-14T23:30:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Usually, struct should be arguments:\nint write_chunk(struct queue const *q,\n                struct queue_chunk *chunk);\nWe avoid the memory copy or the implicit pointer setup.",
      "revId": "1c0c219732969ae46263c4c3f9682a9272c25127",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
